				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5188</guid>
				<title>SCP-5188</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5188</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Item #: SCP-5188&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;image-container floatright&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/710437447921827910/793601258173759488/frying_pan_1.png&quot; alt=&quot;frying_pan_1.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Object Class: Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Special Containment Procedures: this object must be kept in specific conditions to appease itself; must be placed in a room similar to the one that it was found in, that being a teenager boy’s room with some peculiar specialities. The room must be blacked out and away from most light, it must contain a gaming pc with RGB lights being the only illuminated object; there must also be an exceptionally small cot which is presumed to be the bed of the teenager boy. Must also have a formula series F08-NR DX racer that is set to the shortest setting for optimum recollection of the room in which this object was ceased. This object should be placed in the direct centre of the room to avoid any meaningful disasters. If deciding to enter the room for whatever reason subjects must be walking on their knees to replicate the height of the teenager as well as excess grease placed into the hair on the subject choosing to enter; it is recommended that they have spots for a more convincing appeal. SCP-5188-2 must be let in every midnight to feed SCP-5188 -1 and can only be let in via cat flap as SCP-5188-2 cannot interact with doors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Description: SCP-5188-1 is said to be a clean pan, this pan is exceptionally clean and under close observation has shown not a single microbe or pathogen or any other grime to be found upon this object. If anything is placed onto SCP-5188 it will be almost instantly cleaned which sometimes leads to chaotic affects (see more in addendum 1).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite possessing some supernatural powers this entity is a perfect carbon copy of the latest █████ expertise non-stick aluminium frying pan of 21cm with the only difference being that it has danger mouse imprinted where the █████ logo should be with the initials of A.L; █████ have no recollection of this pan ever being created and the day this would found was the same day that █████ stopped production of the █████ expertise non-stick aluminium frying pan of 21cm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;image-container floatright&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/722041922264498186/793598785011712010/alex_lloyd.png&quot; alt=&quot;alex_lloyd.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;supposed teenager boy that A.L would have looked like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dimensions are 21cm diameter with a depth of 6cm. The handle is 13cm long and 5cm in diameter. Weighs 853g. Is oven safe up to 175 degrees Celsius but is not microwave safe, proven to be dishwasher safe but dishwasher has no cleaning effect. Black in colour with a non-conductive handle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5188-2: white blob-like lifeform that dwells in the same living space alongside SCP-5188-1; this will not leave the sight of the pan and will provide £200 or $270.58 when SCP-5188-1 calls out for it late at night. The blob consists of an off white viscous matter. Seems to act like a fatherly figure towards SCP-5188-1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addendum 1: SCP-5188-1 has cleaned numerous objects and so testing has exceeded point or trailing on a human subject. Dr ██████ obliged to testing and after following the procedures went to try and be cleaned by SCP-5188-1. Upon stepping on the pan the effects were clear to see. All and any dirt was soon removed by the pan and Dr ██████ said that he felt little microorganisms crawling around his entire body at once. The test had to soon be stopped as he was aggressively being cleaned and anything impure was stripped from his body so all hair and grime on his skin was removed alongside any bugs or microscopic creatures living around his body but without these to protect us in our everyday life he soon dropped from feeling so weak and the experiment had to be cancelled. Upon examination his skin was perfectly clean but all slight wounds on any part of him let the pan work it’s way inside and most of his organs and blood flow had stopped.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addendum 2: the teenager boy that this pan was taken from has never been heard or seen before; after taking SCP-5188-1 people seem to have forgot about the teenager boy and the boy himself has not been seen since the removal of the pan but SCP-5188-1 has not seemed to notice the disappearance of the boy due to our safety precautions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addendum 3: if the safety procedures are not followed then SCP-5188-1 seems to grow a level of sentience by spraying out every disease and illness within a 10 metre radius until every surface is completely covered; upon touching any of these surfaces it will kill people instantly from every disease (this includes diseases that have long been extinct like plague, cholera, scurvy, smallpox, etc). It is not known how SCP-5188-1 has these and it is said that this pan could have been on earth for a very long time slowly gathering all these diseases but then SCP-5188-1 must also possess time travel or future prediction abilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addendum 4: further testing has shown that the mysterious disappearance the teenager boy links with the finding of a clean pan and the initials carved into the pan coincide with the name of the boy that went missing; the pan has also been known to groan late at night and will only stop when precisely £200 or $270.58 worth of food has been placed into the room showing that SCP-5188-1 is alive to some extent. Studies of the pan show that this pan makes people ‘feel’ lifeless when around the object and so SCP-5188-1 must have some correlation with the taking and adapting of souls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Incident SCP-5188- 1: MTF Zeta-9 (“Mole Rats”) were sent to investigate strange noises coming from a homestead in ██████. Upon first entry the home was covered in the viscous white substance and was oozing out of every surface. The echoing of groaning was throughout the homestead and was most powerful in A.L’s room. When entering the room the groaning reached 15 kilohertz. Upon inspection there rested SCP-5188-1 in the mathematical centre of the room with SCP-5188-2 just about to provide £200 worth of food; MTF Zeta-9 are not sure of where this £200 worth of food came from as house was completely barren at the time. MTF Zeta-9&amp;#160;7 was instructed to obtain SCP-5188-1 but upon doing so SCP-5188-2 proceeded to engulf Zeta-9&amp;#160;7 and the rest of the squadron was forced to flee.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addendum 5: SCP-5188-2 has been proven to be made of male gametes: sperm after vigorous sensory testing and has been dubbed by junior staff as “coomer dad” due to its protective nature over SCP-5188-1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/owenisthebox&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7175813&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609340690&quot; alt=&quot;owenisthebox&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7175813)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/owenisthebox&quot;  &gt;owenisthebox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2020 22:09:29 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p>Item #: SCP-5188</p> <div class="image-container floatright"><img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/710437447921827910/793601258173759488/frying_pan_1.png" alt="frying_pan_1.png" class="image" /></div> <p>Object Class: Safe</p> <p>Special Containment Procedures: this object must be kept in specific conditions to appease itself; must be placed in a room similar to the one that it was found in, that being a teenager boy’s room with some peculiar specialities. The room must be blacked out and away from most light, it must contain a gaming pc with RGB lights being the only illuminated object; there must also be an exceptionally small cot which is presumed to be the bed of the teenager boy. Must also have a formula series F08-NR DX racer that is set to the shortest setting for optimum recollection of the room in which this object was ceased. This object should be placed in the direct centre of the room to avoid any meaningful disasters. If deciding to enter the room for whatever reason subjects must be walking on their knees to replicate the height of the teenager as well as excess grease placed into the hair on the subject choosing to enter; it is recommended that they have spots for a more convincing appeal. SCP-5188-2 must be let in every midnight to feed SCP-5188 -1 and can only be let in via cat flap as SCP-5188-2 cannot interact with doors.</p> <p>Description: SCP-5188-1 is said to be a clean pan, this pan is exceptionally clean and under close observation has shown not a single microbe or pathogen or any other grime to be found upon this object. If anything is placed onto SCP-5188 it will be almost instantly cleaned which sometimes leads to chaotic affects (see more in addendum 1).</p> <p>Despite possessing some supernatural powers this entity is a perfect carbon copy of the latest █████ expertise non-stick aluminium frying pan of 21cm with the only difference being that it has danger mouse imprinted where the █████ logo should be with the initials of A.L; █████ have no recollection of this pan ever being created and the day this would found was the same day that █████ stopped production of the █████ expertise non-stick aluminium frying pan of 21cm.</p> <div class="image-container floatright"><img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/722041922264498186/793598785011712010/alex_lloyd.png" alt="alex_lloyd.png" class="image" /></div> <p>supposed teenager boy that A.L would have looked like</p> <p>Dimensions are 21cm diameter with a depth of 6cm. The handle is 13cm long and 5cm in diameter. Weighs 853g. Is oven safe up to 175 degrees Celsius but is not microwave safe, proven to be dishwasher safe but dishwasher has no cleaning effect. Black in colour with a non-conductive handle</p> <p>SCP-5188-2: white blob-like lifeform that dwells in the same living space alongside SCP-5188-1; this will not leave the sight of the pan and will provide £200 or $270.58 when SCP-5188-1 calls out for it late at night. The blob consists of an off white viscous matter. Seems to act like a fatherly figure towards SCP-5188-1.</p> <p>Addendum 1: SCP-5188-1 has cleaned numerous objects and so testing has exceeded point or trailing on a human subject. Dr ██████ obliged to testing and after following the procedures went to try and be cleaned by SCP-5188-1. Upon stepping on the pan the effects were clear to see. All and any dirt was soon removed by the pan and Dr ██████ said that he felt little microorganisms crawling around his entire body at once. The test had to soon be stopped as he was aggressively being cleaned and anything impure was stripped from his body so all hair and grime on his skin was removed alongside any bugs or microscopic creatures living around his body but without these to protect us in our everyday life he soon dropped from feeling so weak and the experiment had to be cancelled. Upon examination his skin was perfectly clean but all slight wounds on any part of him let the pan work it’s way inside and most of his organs and blood flow had stopped.</p> <p>Addendum 2: the teenager boy that this pan was taken from has never been heard or seen before; after taking SCP-5188-1 people seem to have forgot about the teenager boy and the boy himself has not been seen since the removal of the pan but SCP-5188-1 has not seemed to notice the disappearance of the boy due to our safety precautions</p> <p>Addendum 3: if the safety procedures are not followed then SCP-5188-1 seems to grow a level of sentience by spraying out every disease and illness within a 10 metre radius until every surface is completely covered; upon touching any of these surfaces it will kill people instantly from every disease (this includes diseases that have long been extinct like plague, cholera, scurvy, smallpox, etc). It is not known how SCP-5188-1 has these and it is said that this pan could have been on earth for a very long time slowly gathering all these diseases but then SCP-5188-1 must also possess time travel or future prediction abilities.</p> <p>Addendum 4: further testing has shown that the mysterious disappearance the teenager boy links with the finding of a clean pan and the initials carved into the pan coincide with the name of the boy that went missing; the pan has also been known to groan late at night and will only stop when precisely £200 or $270.58 worth of food has been placed into the room showing that SCP-5188-1 is alive to some extent. Studies of the pan show that this pan makes people ‘feel’ lifeless when around the object and so SCP-5188-1 must have some correlation with the taking and adapting of souls.</p> <p>Incident SCP-5188- 1: MTF Zeta-9 (“Mole Rats”) were sent to investigate strange noises coming from a homestead in ██████. Upon first entry the home was covered in the viscous white substance and was oozing out of every surface. The echoing of groaning was throughout the homestead and was most powerful in A.L’s room. When entering the room the groaning reached 15 kilohertz. Upon inspection there rested SCP-5188-1 in the mathematical centre of the room with SCP-5188-2 just about to provide £200 worth of food; MTF Zeta-9 are not sure of where this £200 worth of food came from as house was completely barren at the time. MTF Zeta-9&#160;7 was instructed to obtain SCP-5188-1 but upon doing so SCP-5188-2 proceeded to engulf Zeta-9&#160;7 and the rest of the squadron was forced to flee.</p> <p>Addendum 5: SCP-5188-2 has been proven to be made of male gametes: sperm after vigorous sensory testing and has been dubbed by junior staff as “coomer dad” due to its protective nature over SCP-5188-1</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/owenisthebox" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7175813&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609340690" alt="owenisthebox" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7175813)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/owenisthebox" >owenisthebox</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/voices</guid>
				<title>Voices</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/voices</link>
				<description>


&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jeffreycc&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5913267&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609340690&quot; alt=&quot;JeffreyCC&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5913267)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jeffreycc&quot;  &gt;JeffreyCC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 28 Dec 2020 02:27:49 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><em>Ten great kings took ten great thrones,<br /> Nine crowns adorned nine heads.<br /> One left to scratch upon their mounds,<br /> The crow, alive and dead.</em></p> </div> <hr /> <p>It started when old Hubard, drunk out his mind on stale mead and the dulled memories of some battle he’d probably run from, locked himself in a shack just outside of Goldweald. Davil tried to break the door in, good neighbor as he was, but the miserable fossil had more strength than anyone could have anticipated, bracing his entire body against the entrance as he babbled about heights and spiders and being pecked to death by birds. No one believed the man was being pecked to death by anything but a bottle, so we all went home, assuming, as one does, that with a day to dry out, the ordeal would sort itself.</p> <p>Took only one night.</p> <p>First scream ripped across the village like someone had pulled it out of Hubard’s open chest, followed by a second that was almost the same—but worse. It pitched higher, like rusted metal wrapped in burlap, in almost-human words with an almost-human rhythm until the baker’s wife cried, “Mages!” and all hell broke loose. People arming themselves, the mayor—if that's what you could call the head of some hinterlands piss-hole—shooing whoever he could into the meeting hall, windows being boarded up in blind panic, the works. You’ve seen it a hundred times, probably two hundred since the Claw hit up north. Regular folks going mad at the fairest hint of magic.</p> <p>Point is, that’s around when everything went bad. But there’s a bottom to bad, and what happened in Goldweald broke right past it.</p> <p>Don’t believe me?</p> <p>Go for yourself. Goldweald ain’t there anymore.</p> <p>But I’m skipping ahead, and that ain’t fair to Davil. See, Davil was a spy from back when the Freljord pacifications were still talked about like there was honor in ’em, and he later served the crown as far out as Shurima and the Blue Flame Isles. The man had seen things. We’re lucky out west, since the worst the hinterlands have to offer are some stray raptors after the hatching season, and maybe a sun-cooked bandit or three, but Davil knew what was out there. What could be out there. And he gathered up all the folk who were willing to listen and organized a peasant militia to bring those supposed “mages” to justice.</p> <p>His plan was simple: First light, we’re all going on patrol, two by two, no one alone. Military stuff, and that gives us hope, gins us all up for a fight.</p> <p>Until the sun comes up and a family’s gone missing.</p> <p>Every one of them—five in all. Farmhouse torn to shreds, livestock slaughtered in their pens. Doors all locked from the inside, windows all latched. They’re gone. The mayor calls a meeting, but a pair of fieldhands don’t come in from the rows. When Davil calls for them, something calls back. But it isn’t them. Sounds almost like them, like something is forcing words into almost the right shape, but that old, rusty cage sound keeps cutting through, squeaking and rattling and clicking like it can’t help itself.</p> <p>Now people are afraid. Some hothead charges into the fields with a sword in his hand—gone. Another follows him—gone. Blacksmith gets the wise idea he’ll ride all the way to Amberfel and call the guard, but the horse bucks him halfway down the old trade road and something pulls him into the rows. Davil calls to see if he’s alright, and that awful voice burbles out, saying it’ll take the road to Amberfel and call the guard.</p> <p>Davil asks again, and it repeats: “I’ll take the old road to Amberfel and call the guard.”<br /> There’s something about it… like a pin twisting inside your head, poking through the meat into something darker underneath. I could see it on everyone’s faces. Folks holding their kids close, backing away toward their homes, some just running. That voice could cut away all the parts of a person and leave ’em naked and afraid, shivering in the middle of a blistering afternoon.</p> <p>Like it was pulling something out of you. Something it wanted.</p> <p>A little girl says she saw someone standing above the field out where we keep the scarecrow. It’s such an odd thing to notice, and there’s so much going on, that we pay her no mind.<br /> But we should have.</p> <p>Night comes and half the houses in town are boarded shut. You can hear folks inside whispering, muttering, giggling like maniacs, but about… I’m not sure. Snakes. Lightning. The dark. Walls closing in. Knives. The sea. They’re laughing and they’re screaming and it sounds like everyone has gone insane, like they’re trapped inside a room with a part of themselves they don’t want to face. It sounds like we’re all stuck in a nightmare.</p> <p>Then the lights start going out. One after the other in all the boarded-up houses, the lamps flicker and die. And the voices melt away, each suddenly silenced, all save for one. Something croaking behind the old smithy. Muttering to itself. About snakes. About lighting. Muttering about the dark.<br /> Davil, that poor fool, takes the militia and goes in. And I… I’m there with him. I have my blade. I have my lantern. But the rows are deep, and the light casts shadows everywhere you look.</p> <p>I… I don’t know exactly what happened. I saw a face—maybe. Something looking back at me just ahead of Davil, but it was like he saw right past it. Like that face was just there for me. All lopsided, twisted sackcloth and rusted teeth. And behind it… something huge. Splayed out on thin legs, but alive with hundreds of black birds rattling inside an old cage we’d thrown into the woods last year. And eyes. So many eyes.</p> <p>There’s no one left in Goldweald now. If no one came after me… I’m the only one left. Hearing those screams fade behind me as crimson light poured out from between the corn stalks—that sickly crunching, and the bellowing, tortured squeals of hogs and horses…</p> <p>And the crows! Hundreds of them—thousands! But crows they aren’t, can’t you see? They’re smoke and fire! They’re not real! They couldn’t be real…</p> <p>They follow that voice! The deep, rumbling voice beneath it all! Don’t you see? Don’t you—<br /> Oh, gods… Davil! I left him behind! I left him there—there in the rows with that horrible scarecrow! Everyone—they’re all dead! Gods, gods, it must have followed me. Once it tastes your fear, once it knows you, it never lets go. It won’t let you go, it won’t—</p> <p><span style="font-size:120%;">What’s that voice?</span></p> <p><span style="font-size:130%;">Can anyone hear—</span></p> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">You don’t hear it?</span></p> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">…Davil?</span></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jeffreycc" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5913267&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609340690" alt="JeffreyCC" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5913267)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jeffreycc" >JeffreyCC</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
